  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Crear capacidades locales para el fortalecimiento organizativo, mejoramiento de la produccin agroecolgica y la economa familiar en comunidades indgenas de Mojarra y Llano Tugr, Comarca Ngbe Bugl.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indigenous farming communities in the Ngbe-Bugl Comarca face a variety of challenges including an inadequate food supply extreme weather events and lack of access to basic services. The IAF supports community-led solutions that enhance food security and disaster resilience in Panama. Our grantee partner Fundacin de Organizaciones Campesinas e Indgenas de Veraguas (FOCIV) offers technical assistance to community leaders to develop skills in sustainable farming adaptation to natural disasters and engaging local officials to provide access to basic services. FOCIV&apos;s activities strengthen grassroots organizations and communities through education and training improving food security among the Ngbe-Bugl.</narrative>
  </description>
